		"description": "<p>The smallest of the fair folk. Whimsical and unpredictable. Pixies are usually considered harmless, but can be surprisingly competent in combat – especially if mistaken for an insect.</p><hr><p><strong>Tricksy</strong></p><p>-1 Speed. [A]</p><p>You have a fly Speed as long as you are wearing armor no heavier than leather. [A — disable the rule manually while wearing heavier armor]</p><p>Advantage on Stealth. [M]</p><p>You know Elvish if your INT isn’t negative. [A]</p><hr><p><em>Nim+ Volume I — submitted by SanityWithIn.</em></p>",
